    "This portfolio displays public films, photographs, news, awards, biography information, and professional contact details selected by Kassandra. The private administration area is restricted to authorised editors.": "本作品集展示由卡桑德拉选定的公开电影、照片、新闻、奖项、个人简介及工作联系方式。私密的管理后台仅限授权编辑访问。",
    "Contact messages": "联系留言",
    "If the contact form is enabled and you submit it, your name, email address, message, submission time, and limited technical information used for abuse prevention are stored so Kassandra can read and respond to your enquiry. Do not include sensitive information you do not want to share. Messages are marked with a review date but are not automatically deleted.": "如果联系表单已启用且你提交了表单，你的姓名、电子邮箱、留言、提交时间以及用于防止滥用的少量技术信息将被保存，以便卡桑德拉阅读并回复你的咨询。请勿填写你不希望分享的敏感信息。留言会标注审查日期，但不会被自动删除。",
    "Cookies and analytics": "Cookie 与统计",
    "The administration area uses essential authentication technology. Optional analytics loads only after an explicit acceptance, if analytics has been configured.": "管理后台使用必要的身份验证技术。可选统计功能即使已配置，也只会在你明确同意后加载。",
    "Third-party services": "第三方服务",
    "Public links may take you to Instagram, Vimeo, YouTube, IMDb, Letterboxd, Stage 32, or X. Those services process information under their own terms. Translations are built into this website, so choosing another language does not send page text to any outside service. Some portfolio photography may be delivered by Unsplash.": "公开链接可能会带你前往 Instagram、Vimeo、YouTube、IMDb、Letterboxd、Stage 32 或 X。这些服务会按照各自的条款处理信息。本网站的翻译为内置功能，选择其他语言不会将页面文字发送给任何外部服务。部分作品集照片可能由 Unsplash 提供。",
