    "Legal review": "法律审查",
    "Retention periods, lawful bases, international transfers, and jurisdiction-specific obligations require confirmation by a qualified privacy professional before launch.": "数据保存期限、合法依据、跨境传输及各司法辖区的特定义务，需在上线前由合格的隐私专业人士确认。",
    "This page explains the browser storage and similar technology currently used by the portfolio.": "本页面说明本作品集目前使用的浏览器存储及类似技术。",
    "Public portfolio": "公开作品集",
    "The public portfolio does not require optional analytics. If analytics is configured, it is not loaded until you select “Accept analytics.” Analytics and language choices are saved in local browser storage.": "公开作品集无需可选统计功能。即使已配置，在你选择“接受统计”之前也不会加载。统计和语言选择会保存在浏览器的本地存储中。",
    "Language translation": "翻译",
    "Translations are built into this website, so no page text is sent to an outside translation service. If you select another language, that choice is saved in local browser storage so it can be remembered on your next visit.": "本网站的翻译为内置功能，页面文字不会发送给任何外部翻译服务。如果你选择其他语言，该选择会保存在浏览器的本地存储中，以便下次访问时沿用。",
    "Administration": "管理",
